Date: Thu, 4 Jun 2026 15:26:27 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat(splithttp): custom session ID generation

Port of XTLS/Xray-core#6258 (Custom sessionID).

Adds two splithttp config fields:
- sessionIDTable: character set ('base62', 'hex', 'HEX', or literal ASCII)
- sessionIDLength: '<n>' or '<from>-<to>' random length range
---
